{"signature": "cd7437c36abe11dec3106c7277ca3d174126a104fbf3ca0b25f765c919e8288a", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "github", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests", "field": "id", "values": ["harmonygames-Games/match3d#317", "harmonygames-Games/match3d#328", "harmonygames-Games/match3d#369"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2291", "field": "id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#317", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#317", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 317, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/daily login merge", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Implement daily reward and chest reward\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a comprehensive Daily Gift system, including daily login rewards, chest rewards, and a new UI for claiming and tracking gifts.\n  * Added new UI components: daily gift boxes, progress bar, reward items, and controller to manage daily gift interactions.\n  * Implemented backend integration for fetching and claiming daily login and chest rewards.\n  * Added new reward types: InfiniteGlue and InfiniteTrampoline.\n  * Added a debug option to reset daily login progress for testing purposes.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Expanded reward handling logic to support new infinite reward types.\n  * Improved UI feedback and animation for claiming daily gifts and chest rewards.\n\n* **Assets**\n  * Added new sprites and metadata for daily gift UI and progress visuals.\n  * Added Unity prefab and script metadata for all new Daily Gift components.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9e633c7675d33a396f85c738edb2a2a713cb543c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/DailyLoginMerge", "head_sha": "a87c6e4e299b7982992f98607e6cc31464138860", "additions": 17281, "deletions": 7, "changed_files": 89, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-18T20:44:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2303", "field": "id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#328", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#328", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 328, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/daily login merge", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fix displaying tooltip in Daily Login chest reward.\r\nAvoid displaying coin amount if pre level is active, and displaying again when closing daily login screen.\r\nChange chapter unlock for daily gift.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Improved daily gift animation and reward display, including enhanced tooltip behavior for chests.\n  * Tooltips now visually update to show rewards and reposition for the final chest in the progress bar.\n  * Added ability to reposition tooltips dynamically for better UI alignment.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed issues with canvas sorting during daily gift animations to ensure proper display order.\n\n* **Other Improvements**\n  * Adjusted the minimum chapter requirement for unlocking daily gifts.\n  * Enhanced debug logging for tooltip rewards.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a961cce7dadfa1b0d46bdf38d58523a1c6781381", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/DailyLoginMerge", "head_sh